===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɒkɪt}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[tooth]]ed wheel that [[enmesh]]es with a [[chain]] or other [[perforated]] [[band]].
# {{usually|plural}} The tooth of such a wheel.
# {{architecture}} A [[flare]]d extension at the base of a sloped roof.

===Usage notes===
A ''[[gear]]'' is a a toothed wheel that meshes directly with another toothed wheel; a ''[[pulley]]'' is a wheel with or without teeth that drives a non-perforated band.

